@startuml Goods Receipt Creation - Sequence Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceActorFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceBoxFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontName Times New Roman

title Sequence Diagram - Membuat Penerimaan Barang (Checker)

actor "Checker" as Checker
participant "Filament UI" as UI
participant "GR Resource" as Resource
participant "GoodsReceipt\nModel" as GR
participant "Shipment\nModel" as Shipment
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Notification" as Notif

== Terima Notifikasi ==
Notif -> Checker: Notifikasi:\n"DO Shipped"

== Lihat Delivery Order ==
Checker -> UI: Akses menu Delivery Order
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request DO list (status=Shipped)
activate Resource
Resource -> DB: Query shipments where status=Shipped
activate DB
DB --> Resource: Shipment data
deactivate DB
Resource --> UI: DO list
deactivate Resource
UI --> Checker: Tampilkan daftar DO (Shipped)
deactivate UI

Checker -> UI: Pilih Delivery Order
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request DO details
activate Resource
Resource -> Shipment: Get shipment with details
activate Shipment
Shipment -> DB: Query shipment & dokumen
activate DB
DB --> Shipment: Complete data
deactivate DB
Shipment --> Resource: Shipment with details
deactivate Shipment
Resource --> UI: DO detail & dokumen scan
deactivate Resource
UI --> Checker: Tampilkan detail DO & dokumen
deactivate UI

Checker -> Checker: Verifikasi dokumen DO

alt Dokumen Sesuai
    == Buat Penerimaan Barang ==
    Checker -> UI: Klik "Buat Penerimaan Barang"
    activate UI
    UI -> Resource: Show GR form
    activate Resource
    Resource --> UI: Form penerimaan
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Checker: Tampilkan form
    deactivate UI

    Checker -> Checker: Periksa kondisi fisik barang

    Checker -> UI: Input data penerimaan:\n- Jumlah diterima & ditolak\n- Alasan penolakan (jika ada)\n- Upload dokumen POD
    activate UI
    UI -> Resource: Submit GR data
    activate Resource

    note right of Resource
        - Generate nomor GRN
        - Set status = Pending
        - Set received_by = Checker
    end note

    Resource -> GR: Create goods receipt
    activate GR
    GR -> DB: Save GR & details
    activate DB
    DB --> GR: Success
    deactivate DB
    GR --> Resource: GoodsReceipt instance
    deactivate GR

    Resource -> Shipment: Update status to Arrived
    activate Shipment
    Shipment -> DB: Update shipment
    activate DB
    DB --> Shipment: Success
    deactivate DB
    Shipment --> Resource: Updated
    deactivate Shipment

    Resource -> Notif: Send notification to Admin Gudang
    activate Notif
    Notif --> Resource: Sent
    deactivate Notif

    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Checker: Tampilkan hasil\n"Penerimaan barang created (Pending)"
    deactivate UI
else Dokumen Tidak Sesuai
    Checker -> UI: Tandai dokumen tidak sesuai
    activate UI
    UI --> Checker: Error: "Dokumen tidak sesuai"
    deactivate UI

    Checker -> Checker: Hubungi supplier
end

@enduml
